PRE-FLIGHT
  ├─ Tag all subjects: GENERAL | MERGED | REGULAR
  ├─ LOCKED ← all GENERAL subjects (tag: "General")
  ├─ MERGED_GROUPS ← all detected merge sets (tag: "Original" if pre-existing)
  └─ PENDING ← everything else

STAGE 1: Fix MERGED_GROUPS
  ├─ For each merged group:
  │    └─ Check conflict against LOCKED
  │         └─ If conflict → reschedule group as a unit (GA optimizer)
  ├─ Then check merged-vs-merged conflicts
  │    └─ Reschedule conflicting groups as units
  └─ RESOLVED ← LOCKED ∪ fixed MERGED_GROUPS

STAGE 2: Triage PENDING
  ├─ For each pending subject:
  │    ├─ Conflict with RESOLVED? → keep in PENDING for GA
  │    └─ No conflict? → move to RESOLVED
  └─ Loop until stable

STAGE 3: GA Optimizer on PENDING
  ├─ Clear schedules/rooms of PENDING subjects
  ├─ Run GA with RESOLVED as hard constraints
  ├─ Validate output:
  │    ├─ Internal conflicts within new schedule?
  │    └─ Conflicts against RESOLVED?
  ├─ Conflict-free new subjects → move to RESOLVED
  ├─ Still-conflicted → back to PENDING
  └─ Repeat (max N iterations, then escalate)

OUTPUT
  └─ Concat RESOLVED (LOCKED + MERGED_GROUPS + GA-generated)
     with tags preserved.